rrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Unreachable Code Error</span></a></li><li value=\"8\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/cpp/cpp-program-to-show-thread-interface-and-memory-consistency-errors/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Thread and Memory Errors</span></a></li></ul><h2 id=\"c-date-and-time-programs\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span>C++ Date and Time Programs</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>In this section, we see how to handle data and times in our programs.</span></p><ul><li value=\"1\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/cpp/print-calendar-for-a-given-year/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Calendar Dates</span></a></li><li value=\"2\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/cpp/cpp-program-print-current-day-date-time/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Current Date and Time</span></a></li><li value=\"3\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/c/gmtime-function-in-c-c/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Local Time to GMT</span></a></li></ul><h2 id=\"c-miscellaneous-programs\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span>C++ Miscellaneous Programs</span></h2><ul><li value=\"1\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/cpp/cpp-program-to-find-quotient-and-remainder/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Quotient &amp; Remainder</span></a></li><li value=\"2\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/cpp/cpp-program-to-find-the-size-of-int-float-double-and-char/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>sizeof() Operator</span></a></li><li value=\"3\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/cpp/cpp-program-to-find-the-initials-of-a-name/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Name Initials</span></a></li><li value=\"4\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/cpp/cpp-program-to-find-power-without-using-multiplication-and-division-operators/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Power Without Using * and / Operators</span></a><span> <